   "message": "I think historical attitudes toward mythology is much like our current relationship with conspiracy theories\n\nsome take it literally, some take it allegorically, some theories are literally mythology mixed with reality (David icke, Candice owns)\n\nyou think it's a minority of people that take it seriously, but the views of these people get a lot of attention, there is an apatite for it",
