   "platform": "discord",
   "server": "ORI 1.0 (2025)",
   "server_id": "discord:1344300408893345863"
  },
  {
   "user": "O_oNevermore",
   "message": "I think this multi semanticity is only ever discussed in relationship with relativism\n\nartists and directors say \"oh no the ended means whatever the audience wants it to mean, my intention isn't important\"\n\npeople do understand that art being interpretable differently by different people is a feature not a bug\n\nbut what they get wrong when they fall into relativism and say there is no ultimate meaning\n\nthe feature is meant to be used so that art delivers a different message to different observers, not arbitrary messages, real important meanings to specific types of people",
   "timestamp": "2026-08-05T08:59:56.965000+00:00",
