   "user": "Defender",
   "message": "The most objective metric we can all start with is simple occurrence. This is the same one meme coin communities use. \n\nFor Katt's \"TOTAL CLANKER GENOCIDE\" we just search that phrase on twitter, and on bluesky, and see if it is uttered there (last time I checked there was a ton of discourse around it on twitter but almost nothing on bluesky)",
