   "message": "The list of \"territories\" here gives us an initial map, if an artifact you created gets on the front page of Hacker News for example that's successful penetration in the tech sphere (even if you can't get it up there, you can drop comments in reply to popular posts to seed it)\n\nhttps://www.psyop.report/p/monitored-territories",
