   "user": "Defender",
   "message": "This is an example of a \"local operation\" in Ithaca. There is no one in my network who interacts with this homeless encampment in the city, I wanted to find one and also test if people are even aware of it. So I designed this engaging post that seeds the question: https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/1tp7k4z/what_is_your_relationship_to_the_jungle/\n\nI measured its success by it getting to the front page of r/ithaca, and seeing if it triggered discussion in the Ithaca discords that I'm a part of, and IRL discussions",
